stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Unplaced
    Unplaced --> Opening: placement selected
    Opening --> Ready: backend opened
    Opening --> Retrying: open failed
    Retrying --> Opening: retry
    Ready --> Opening: replacement selected
    Ready --> Unplaced: placement removed
    Opening --> Unplaced: placement removed
    Retrying --> Unplaced: placement removed
    Unplaced --> Closed: mount ends
    Opening --> Closed: mount ends
    Ready --> Closed: mount ends
    Retrying --> Closed: mount ends
    Closed --> [*]
    note right of Ready
      Publish state and notify atomically.
      Waiters resample outside notification.
      Cancel and deadline end their own wait.
    end note
